1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,083
This guide is for voters. You open the voting link you were given.

2
00:00:05,683 --> 00:00:13,756
If the poll asks for an account, you sign in or create one. Some polls let anyone with
the link vote straight away.

3
00:00:14,356 --> 00:00:20,095
Choose one candidate for each position and press Vote. Your vote is secret.

4
00:00:20,695 --> 00:00:26,873
You are thanked straight away, and if the organizer allows it, you can watch the live
results.

5
00:00:27,473 --> 00:00:31,197
NTSOne. Secure voting.
